      <p class="hp-hero-sub" style="color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:65ch">
        The group operates two research labs. The <strong>Space Instrumentation Lab</strong> maintains ground-based magnetometer networks (SAMBA chain) and supports field campaigns. The <strong>Space Weather Lab</strong> develops real-time monitoring and ML-based prediction systems for geomagnetic disturbances and relativistic electron dynamics.
